#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Introduction to Qiskit and IBM Quantum {#introduction-to-qiskit-and-ibm-"
"quantum}"
msgstr ""
"Pengenalan Qiskit dan IBM Quantum {#introduction-to-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Welcome to the documentation for [Qiskit](/guides/tools-intro), its related "
"packages, and IBM Quantum&reg; Platform. This documentation includes how-to "
"guides to get you started on our tools, specific use-case tutorials that "
"include end-to-end examples, and a collection of API references.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang di dokumentasi untuk [Qiskit](/guides/tools-intro), paket-"
"paket terkaitnya, dan IBM Quantum&reg; Platform. Dokumentasi ini mencakup "
"panduan cara penggunaan untuk membantu Anda memulai dengan alat-alat kami, "
"tutorial kasus penggunaan spesifik yang menyertakan contoh end-to-end, serta"
" kumpulan referensi API.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit provides a modular and extensible framework for quantum research and "
"development across algorithms, high-performance computing, and quantum "
"information science. With it, researchers can build, optimize, and execute "
"quantum workflows with [specialized addons](/guides/addons), software tools,"
" and extensive resources. Through IBM Quantum Platform, users can access "
"[quantum compute](/guides/compute-services) services, such as Qiskit Runtime"
" and the Qiskit Functions Catalog, to run workloads efficiently on the "
"IBM&reg; fleet of quantum computers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit menyediakan kerangka kerja yang modular dan dapat diperluas untuk "
"penelitian dan pengembangan kuantum di berbagai bidang algoritma, komputasi "
"berkinerja tinggi, dan ilmu informasi kuantum. Dengan Qiskit, para peneliti "
"dapat membangun, mengoptimalkan, dan mengeksekusi alur kerja kuantum "
"menggunakan [addon khusus](/guides/addons), alat perangkat lunak, dan sumber"
" daya yang lengkap. Melalui IBM Quantum Platform, pengguna dapat mengakses "
"layanan [quantum compute](/guides/compute-services), seperti Qiskit Runtime "
"dan Qiskit Functions Catalog, untuk menjalankan beban kerja secara efisien "
"di armada komputer kuantum IBM&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![A graphic showing the different components of IBM Quantum Platform and "
"Qiskit.](/docs/images/guides/index/overview-image.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Grafik yang menunjukkan berbagai komponen IBM Quantum Platform dan "
"Qiskit.](/docs/images/guides/index/overview-image.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Beyond Qiskit and its related packages is the [Qiskit "
"ecosystem](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem), a catalog of open-source "
"projects that interface with Qiskit to extend its functionality.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di luar Qiskit dan paket-paket terkaitnya, terdapat [ekosistem "
"Qiskit](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem), yaitu katalog proyek open-"
"source yang terintegrasi dengan Qiskit untuk memperluas fungsionalitasnya.\n"

